<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN SCORE 165 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN SCORE 165 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan scored 165 all out in 48.3 overs against West Indies in the second match in the best-of-three World Series limited overs final at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Monday.</p>
<p>Score - Pakistan 165 all out in 48.3 overs v West Indies.</p>
